### Variables

@apiVersion = /api/v1
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@machineId = 1
@machinesEndpoint = {{baseUrl}}{{apiVersion}}/machines


### 


### Get all machines

GET {{machinesEndpoint}} HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json


### 


### Get machine by ID

GET {{machinesEndpoint}}/{{machineId}} HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json


### 


### Create new machine

POST {{machinesEndpoint}} HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "hospCode": "LAB-EQ-001",
  "name": "Cobas 6000",
  "sectionId": 1
}


### 


### Update machine (partial)

PATCH {{machinesEndpoint}}/{{machineId}} HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "hospCode": "LAB-EQ-002",
  "name": "Cobas 6000 Updated"
}


### 


### Update machine status only

PATCH {{machinesEndpoint}}/{{machineId}} HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Cobas 8000"
}


### 


### Delete machine

DELETE {{machinesEndpoint}}/{{machineId}} HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json


### 
